# Objective-C

Follow skills **objc** and **poteto-objc** when applicable.

- No **NSLog** in library / product shared code without `objc-rg-allow` + rationale (prefer os_log / injected logger)
- No **performSelector:** family without `objc-rg-allow` + rationale (prefer typed IMP / blocks / NSInvocation with proven signature)
- No manual **retain** / **release** / **autorelease** message sends under ARC without `objc-rg-allow` + rationale (prefer ARC; CFRetain/CFRelease only at CF bridge boundaries)
- Product **clang-format** wiring: `.clang-format` at root (or CI clang-format), live dry-run when tool present
- Required product gates: `objc-rg-gate` + `objc-hotpath-gate` + `objc-fmt-gate`. Do not disable checks to force green.
- Prove behaviour with xcodebuild / clang where product needs them, not "lint pass" alone

Repeated review smell twice on an ObjC product: encode into lint/CI/skill, not more prose.
